        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūja kwibona na Yonasani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūpeela wīnga ī Nayoti ya Lama, ūja kūlī Yonasani ūūkamūūja, “Bebe ī gete naakenije mhayo kī? Ū būhūbi wane būlī ha kī? Nankenije kī ū namhala",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Namhala:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū so, baba wako, (na ng'hī. Ja 3,6,8,10.)",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nose alīkooba kūnīngīja būpaga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonasani nang'hwe ūnshokeja alīhaya, “Gūtī gīko, ūtūūcha yaya; nguno ū baba atīko kwīta mhayo gose gose, gūbize ntaale nūūlū ndo, aho ataalī kūnimanya ū nene. Nose nibūlī anibise ū gwenūyū? Ītī gīko na hado yaya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūng'wilahīlīla ū Yonasani alīng'wīla, “Ū so amanile hape gete gīkī ū bebe ūnitogilwe no, na lūūlū wabonile gīkī, ‘Ū Yonasani atizūgūmana ū mhayo gwenūyū, nguno akūpīnīhala kapīnīhalīle kataale no.’ Alīyo nalīkwilahīlīla kūlī SEEBA mpanga, na kū būpanga wako gīkī, ī haha ū nene natī kūle nalyo ī licha” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yonasani ūng'wīla ū Daūdi, “Mhayo gose gose ūyo ūlanilombe nakwītīle nakūkwītīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūhaya, “Alidegelekaga ī ntondo shikūbiza shigukulu sha ng'weji mpya, ū nene shiniigeleelilwe kūlya hamò nū ntemi; alīyo nilekage naje nakibise kū malaale, kūshisha mhīndī ya lūshikū lwa ntondo būngī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūnilula ū namhala ng'wīlage, “Ū Daūdi akanikūmbīlīja nanzunīlīje apeele wangū Betelehemu kū nzengo gwa ng'wawe; ashike kaya nguno a banhū ba lūdūgū lo ng'wawe balīfunya shitambò sha ng'waka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūhaya gīkī, “Ndūhū makoye, numho ū nene ntūmami wako nalī mhola. Alīyo ūlū ūsaaya, a henaho deebaga hape gete gīkī alī na ng'hūmbū ja kūnītīla yabūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū bebe shikwigeleelilwe ūnītīle yawiza, nguno ū nene ntūmami wako ūkaningīja mu shilahīlo sha kwiyilahīja hamò nang'ho kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. Na lūūlū ūlū nalī na būkenaagūji nibūlagage ū bebe; gīsī īlīho nguno kī ya kūnitūūla mu nkono gwa namhala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonasani ūshosha hangī alīhaya, “Yaya ū gwenūyo gūtī gwa kūkwegeela ū bebe; ī gīsī, ūlū ni nagemile nūūlū kūng'ulang'uja hado dūhū gīkī ū baba alīhaya kūkwītīla yabūbi ni nataalī kūkūwīla?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi a henaho ūbūūja, “Alilūūlū ī gīsī, nani akūnimanīkīja ūlū ūkūshokeja na būkalī ū namhala?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonasani ūng'wīla, “Alitūjage kū malaale ūko.” Būfuma būbīlī wabo būja kū malaale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilagane lya ng'wa Yonasani na Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yonasani ūng'wīla ū Daūdi, “Nalīkwilahīlīla kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wa Isilaeli gīkī, ī ntondo būngī kūshika ikanza gītī īlī nakūbiza naahooyaga nū baba. Ī gīsī ūlū ūbiza akūyegelile, numho nakūlekela kī ū kūkwenhela ī mhola nang'ho ūdeebe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū baba ūlū ūbiza alī na ng'hūmbū ja kūkwītīla yabūbi, Ū SEEBA ni anitūlage habbahu na kūtinda ho, ūlū nūūleka kūkwigwīlīja na kūkūlaga ūje mu mhola; hūna ū SEEBA abize hamò nang'ho gīt'ūmo alī hamò na baba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike aho nataalī nalī mu sī, nane ūkūnoolekeja wiza gītī bo ng'wa SEEBA natizūbūlagwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nīyo ū wiza wako ūtizūbīngīja na a banhū ba shibyalīlwe shane, nūūlū ni līkashika ikanza lya ng'wa SEEBA kūbakenaagūla pye a banishi ba ng'wa Daūdi bashile mo gete ū mu sī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Yonasani ūbiza wabeeja ilagane nī kaya ya ng'wa Daūdi; ūhaya, “Ū SEEBA ni abīītīlage ya kūbamalīla shiilī a banishi ba ng'wa Daūdi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonasani ūng'wīta ū Daūdi kūlahīla būpya ī shilahīlo shakwe kūlwa nguno ya būtogwa ūbo walī antogilwe, nguno walī antogilwe gīt'ūmo walī iitogelilwe wei ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yonasani ūng'wīla ū Daūdi, “Ī ntondo shikūbiza shigukulu sha ng'weji mpya, bakūkūlula, nguno ī lisumbī lyako līkūbiza lītī na munhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī mhīndī ya lūshikū ū lwa ntondo būngī, ūkūja ūkibise ū kwipandī īlo walī wibisa ū lūshikū lwene ī mihayo yenīyī īkandīja, aho walī wishīkīja h'iwe lī Ezeli ūlindīīla henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūlasa masonga a datū, gītī munhū akūlasaga shikolo shilebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma nakūntūma nyanda nang'wīle, ‘Jaga ūgasoleela a masonga.’” Ūlū nūng'wīla, “Gasoleelage a masonga, gayo galī bbihī nang'ho kū lwandī lwa kwizīīla kūūnū;” ūlū wigwa gīko nzūgū. Nguno nalīkwilahīlīla kūlī SEEBA mpanga gīkī, numho īlīho mhola; gatīho makoye gose gose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū nūng'wīla ū nyanda gīkī, “Bebe a masonga gayo galī kū būtongi wako ūko, a henaho numho jaga; nguno numho ū SEEBA wakwīnjaga a henaha ūje ipandī līngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī mihayo īyo twīhooyelaga, ī ya ha gatī yako na nene; ū mu yenīyo ū SEEBA alī nkaanīji wise, ū bebe nū nene, shikū ja welelo bose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būpelanu bo ng'wa Saulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Daūdi wibisa ū kū malaale; aho shashika ī shigukulu sha ng'weji mpya, ū ntemi wigasha ū kūlya ī shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wigasha a hisumbī lyakwe lya shikū jose, kū lwandī lwa meeza ū lwa kū ndugu, ū Yonasani wīmīīla iilolile nū ise; ū Abuneeli wigasha bbihī nū Saulo, a ha wigaasho bo ng'wa Daūdi hūbiza dalali ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo ū Saulo atahayile mhayo gose gose, nguno wiganikaga, “Mmho ū Daūdi wilongelilwe mhayo nebe gwang'wītile kūbiza nsoso; atūūkīja kūbiza wasosohalile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo na a ha ntondo yaho, ū lūshikū lwa kabīlī ū mu ng'weji, ū wigaasho bo ng'wa Daūdi walī dalali dūhū. Nose ū Saulo ūmūūja ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Yonasani, “Ni kinehe shi ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yese atūyubyagiho a ha shilīwa? Nguno ī igolo walī atīho, nī lelo atīho!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonasani ūshosha alīhaya, “Ū Daūdi akanikūmbīlīja nanzunīlīje aje Betelehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanilomba alīhaya gīkī, ‘Nizunīlījage naje, nguno a banhū ba lūdūgū lwa ng'wise balīfunya shitambò ū mu nzengo; ū nkūlū wane wanitanile nane nabize nalīko. Akahaya gīkī, Ūlū ūlīnichīla shigongo nizunīlījage naje nakababone a bakūlū baane.’ H'ī nguno yene atīho a ha meeza ya ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū būpelanu bo ng'wa Saulo būmpembekela ū Yonasani; ūng'wīla, “Ū būchilū na būnyang'hani bo ng'wa noko wenūbū, ū bebe ūliganika ū nene natamanile ī gīkī ūlī kū lwandī lwa ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yese, mhayo ūyo gūlī gw'igiisha minala ū kūlī bebe, na gwa magooke ū kūlī noko ūyo wakūbyala? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managa gīkī ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yese aho ataalī alīho ū mu sī īyī, ū bebe ūtīko ū kwīmīīla pyī nū būtemi wako. Na lūūlū lagījaga ī haha enhwe halī nene aha, nguno shing'wigeleelilwe ache!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonasani ūmūūja ū ise, “Nibūlī shing'wigeleelilwe ache? Wītile mhayo kī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Saulo ūponya ichimu gīkī amūlage ū Yonasani; gwike dūhū lyūmfuuja. A henaho ū Yonasani witegeleja gete gīkī gashi ng'hana ū ise walī na ng'hūmbū ja kūmūlaga ū Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīnga a ha meeza wapelanaga no, ū lūshikū lwa kabīlī lwa ng'weji ūleka nū kūlya ī shilīwa kūlwa nguno ya kūpīnīhajiwa nī mihayo ya minala īyo ise wang'wītīlaga ū Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wela ī dilū, ū Yonasani ūja ū kwipandī īlo baalī baalagana kūmaanhīja nū Daūdi; ūja na kayanda kado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkawīla a kayanda kaakwe, “Peelaga ūje ūlīgasoleela a masonga ayo nalīlasa.” A kayanda aho kapeela, ūlasa isonga ū kū būtongi wako lyūkakīlanhya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A kayanda kenako kahayūshika aho līkagwīla ī lisonga lya ng'wa Yonasani, ūūkahamukīla alīhaya, “Bebe ī lisonga, lītī kū būtongi wako?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yonasani ūūkahamukīla hangī alīkawīla, “Jaga wangū! Kangīlījaga, yaya ū kwigedya gedya!” Na ng'hana a kayanda kenako kūūgakumingīja a masonga kūshoka kūlī ntaale wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Alīyo kaalī kataadeebaga ī mihayo yenīyī yalī na makūlū kī; Yonasani na Daūdi dūhū h'abo baalī bamanile.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū Yonasani ūūkinha a kayanda ī shilanga shakwe, ūūkawīla, “Shokaga lūūlū ūshitwale kaya ī shikolo shenīshi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho kīnga a kayanda, ū Daūdi ūbūūka a h'iwe aho walī wibanda; winama ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Yonasani, ūshisha ng'hangala idatū akwinamaga kūshisha wakuumya hasī ū būshū wakwe. Hūna bandya kūlīla būbīlī wabo kūnū bakwibbipaga kūlwa būtogwa, ū Daūdi ūlīla kūtinda no! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonasani ūhaya, “Jaga mu mhola, nguno twaamala kwiyilahīlīla mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA kūbiza na būnwani; tūhaya gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA alī nkaanīji ha gatī yako nū nene, na ha gatī ya shibyalīlwe shane nī shibyalīlwe shako welelo bose.’” Hūna ū Daūdi wīnga ho, ū Yonasani nang'hwe ūshoka mu nzengo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
